# Portfolio Images Directory

This directory contains project photos for the portfolio section.

## Image Requirements:
- Hero images should be 16:9 aspect ratio at 800x450px minimum
- Use JPG format for photographs
- Optimize for web (under 200KB per image)
- Include descriptive alt text in the code

